{
  "_comment": "The two-model SDXL pipeline as it was designed: base lays the image down, refiner finishes the last fifth of the steps. KSamplerAdvanced is required rather than convenient — the base must hand over its leftover noise (return_with_leftover_noise) and the refiner must not add its own, and a plain KSampler cannot express either. Needs a refiner checkpoint; without one the base graph is the right choice instead.",
